From fec395c16def8613ccc566a1cdf84e12adb47345 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: logdog2325 <loganjayfisher@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 24 Jul 2026 15:18:22 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 16/41] Android: public battle lobby (Find Battles)

Android counterpart of the desktop NetPlay Browser: a Sea-themed
session list over Dolphin's public index server, filtered to Pokemon XD
by default, with tap-to-join for traversal and direct sessions,
password support via the index's server-id encryption, and a publish
panel that arms NetPlayServer's built-in index publishing (UseIndex +
name/region config) before hosting. Only same-build sessions are shown,
matching netplay's version requirement.
